  [291, "In the city zoo of Animalia, there was a lioness named Nala. If Nala was given proper veterinary care, then Nala would remain healthy. Also, if Nala was given proper veterinary care, then Nala would live longer in captivity. Does this entail that if Nala was given proper veterinary care, then Nala would remain healthy and live longer in captivity?", "True."],
  [292, "In the prestigious university of Hilltop Heights, there was an intelligent student named Jamie. If Jamie put in the hard work, then Jamie would get good grades. Moreover, if Jamie put in the hard work, then Jamie would gain more knowledge. Does this entail that if Jamie puts in the hard work, Jamie gets good grades and gains more knowledge?", "True."],
  [293, "At the bustling cafe Espresso Love, there was a special drink called the Caramel Macchiato. If the Caramel Macchiato was prepared properly, then it would have a rich flavor. Additionally, if the Caramel Macchiato was prepared properly, then it would have a smooth texture. Does this entail that if the Caramel Macchiato was prepared properly, then it has a rich flavor and smooth texture?", "True."],
