  [1197, "If someone adopts a shelter dog, they have to train it. If a dog has anxiety issues, it will be difficult to train. Either someone adopted a dog, or the dog had anxiety issues, or maybe both were the case. If the dog was hard to train, they had to take it to obedience lessons. And if they did lessons, the dog learned to follow commands. Sam did not have to train his new dog. Did it learn to follow commands?", "True."],
