  [1501, "Sarah is a diligent high school student who studies every day. She realized that if she studies daily, she better learns and absorbs the material. Sarah knows that if she learns the material well, she will earn good grades in her classes. Lately, Sarah makes sure that either she is studying consistently, or she is getting enough sleep - or sometimes both! Sarah has found that if she gets enough shut-eye, she feels well-rested the next day. She has learned that if she feels well-rested, it helps her stay healthy overall. If Sarah does not earn good grades, then does she stay healthy?", "True."],
